# servertest.ini — every key the Project Zomboid dedicated server writes.
#
# Extracted from a real server's generated config: Project Zomboid Dedicated
# Server (Steam app 380870), config written by the server itself, read from
# %USERPROFILE%\Zomboid\Server\servertest.ini.
#
# Why this file exists: Compile writes this file whole, so a key Garrison does
# not know about is a key Garrison would delete. The list has to be complete
# rather than curated, and it has to come from the server rather than from
# documentation — see ADR 0008 and ADR 0011.
#
# Values for anything password- or id-shaped are blanked deliberately: this is
# a real operator's file and the repo is not the place for their secrets.
#
# Format: key<TAB>type<TAB>default
